WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.575
A good model explains a lot, but never everything.

2
00:00:04.326 --> 00:00:08.176
The model predicts that the particles will spread into each other.

3
00:00:10.168 --> 00:00:14.118
They do: diffusion. Moving particles explain it well.

4
00:00:14.794 --> 00:00:19.294
But plain balls can't explain colour, or why substances react.
